"}, {"file_name": "7-2560x1440.png", "id": "1146548799869781", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035337_1146548803203114_4232071023953588234_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8b165yBzfbQQ7kNvwEGKSXz&_nc_oc=Adp_FyVpgkBtiUfYNJ3fuCkgvt8vdTFIdWsqgqVhV-cbditPNWmiT3jYTYc7vRCWs7I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7mRJGX732IIkOlP50WFpnLYjGxzhVZka-b5Nh8AEpR5A&oe=6A1C3A3A"}, {"file_name": "1-2560x1440.png", "id": "999610461677141", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_999610465010474_1087177970663193150_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s9SYNw31Mu0Q7kNvwGIY0DJ&_nc_oc=Adpzy20fK8vMsRSKjPsiZ5I8iFJi9N6Q0UJ45Evf-EkCfxnBEMdi2356RHfGu1LRunQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6taZaTo6RIX9dLGe-HxGx2ci7tdxiy8MXASJ4QYnxpmA&oe=6A1C446B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "427799910014327", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75254872_427799913347660_1009234490175775686_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0SGVOJgk5BIQ7kNvwElKaXz&_nc_oc=AdpX1qW3L-ERz5CLbaZ9muGfjlHebj9MMOwKWb3yDQYY8hNasZS7LrB2FiByKULAgYM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6tDl8lKVledl9r-oS4LBzEHxZQ2WC2c3eiPNENf9U0OA&oe=6A1C400F"}, "display_name": "Hamster Inc.", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to \"Hamster Inc.\"! It's a physics building game that supports \"mixed reality\". In this delightful puzzle game, you'll design, build, and then program machines to overcome challenges!\n\n# Creativity and Logic\n- Based on physical principles and logic, think about how to overcome obstacles and help hamsters improve transportation efficiency.\n{1557136708179895}\n\n# Assembling\n- Design and build a variety of machines with over 60 types of blocks.\n- Over 20 special-function blocks that can be programmed, such as ultrasonic sensors, DC motors, radars and more.\n{327773876776917}\n\n# Graphical programming\n- Super easy! Graphical programming makes your creations \"alive\"!\n{406792278927140}\n\n# Explore 6 unique themes\n- Explore Eastern Forests, Automated factories, Sunshine Coast, Western Gobi, Volcanic Tunnels, and Northern snowfields.\n- As you progress, develop your hamster company and unlock new resources and challenges.\n\n# Enjoy the sandbox mode\n- where you can build and program freely without any limitations on the block amount!\n{971212150879070}\n\n# Mixed Reality\nBring your creations into real world and transform the entire room into a dream paradise: \n- Create custom levels by using real furniture and virtual terrain models, \n- Have your car/drone automatically avoid furniture as it moves around the room,\n- Watch virtual creatures interact with real world: like bison running on tables, floors, or beds!\n{897586709048914}\n\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/NkC8bwQEmK\n", "short_description": "\"Hamster Inc.\" is a physics-based building game that supports \"mixed reality.\"\nIn the game, you can build a variety of interesting inventions such as trebuchets, unmanned trucks, robotic arms, and drones to help the hamsters overcome challenges one after another and continuously develop and expand the logistics territory."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6d77\u62a52560x1440\u5907\u90097-2+logo-\u4e2d\u6587.png", "id": "3772762123041281", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65229464_3772762126374614_5116127187365598796_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cFgY0n2lzAEQ7kNvwFy2RlU&_nc_oc=Adp_GR8EzEdtCNefkKWdVyblIM9wYTCatGqK-eaqnYGEbM0dKp3RjZLt_wmiPEPiwOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7xjDlCwjnD-iI_2C09kMQMX8tTl9sJTkfP3nXaLdX7QQ&oe=6A1C3C59"}, {"file_name": "icon2.png", "id": "1090290192036087", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575